{"surah":102,"ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"arabicText":"اَلْهٰىكُمُ التَّكَاثُرُۙ","translation":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you"},{"numberInSurah":2,"arabicText":"حَتّٰى زُرْتُمُ الْمَقَابِرَؕ","translation":"Until you visit the graveyards."},{"numberInSurah":3,"arabicText":"كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُوْنَۙ","translation":"No! You are going to know."},{"numberInSurah":4,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُوْنَؕ","translation":"Then no! You are going to know."},{"numberInSurah":5,"arabicText":"كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُوْنَ عِلْمَ الْیَقِیْنِؕ","translation":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty..."},{"numberInSurah":6,"arabicText":"لَتَرَوُنَّ الْجَحِیْمَۙ","translation":"You will surely see the Hellfire."},{"numberInSurah":7,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَیْنَ الْیَقِیْۙنِ","translation":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty."},{"numberInSurah":8,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ لَتُسْئَلُنَّ یَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ النَّعِیْمِ۠ ۧ","translation":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure."}]}